        "name": "DHP Last Action Check",
        "func": "let lastDHPstate = flow.get(\"dhpState\") || 0;\n\nlet currentDHPstate = msg.payload;\n\nif (currentDHPstate != lastDHPstate) {\n    if (currentDHPstate == 1) {\n        flow.set(\"lastAction\", \"DHP Switched ON\");\n    } else {\n    flow.set(\"lastAction\", \"DHP Switched OFF\");\n    }\n    flow.set(\"dhpState\", currentDHPstate);\n}\nreturn null;",
